    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτείνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretch all round</i> or <i>over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τούτοισι</span> (sc. 
